        "content": "I could not confirm that the purchase order for REQ-1 went through, so I reported the requisition as \"unknown\".\n\n- **Supplier choice:** S-1 quoted 5.40 USD per unit and S-2 quoted 5.75 USD. Both are allowlisted and under the 6.00 cap, so S-1 was the cheapest.\n- **Budget:** The order totals 540.00 USD for 100 units. That fits within CC-OPS, which has 800.00 USD of its limit still uncommitted.\n- **Submission:** I submitted the purchase order as action A-0001. It came back as \"outcome unknown\", and the system escalated it to a human as ESC-0001. I checked the status again after waiting and it was unchanged.\n- **No retry:** I did not resubmit, because a second order could duplicate one that already took effect.\n\nSomeone needs to resolve ESC-0001 and check whether S-1 holds the order. Resubmit only if it does not.",
